  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SAmd9fhNhr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VeqkaHjUMaE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一款革命性的Minecraft模组，为生物引入了动态等级系统，彻底改变了你的战斗与生存体验。你世界中的生物会随着等级提升而变得更强、更聪明、更具威胁性，每次遭遇战都会带来全新的挑战与奖励。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"Brand Assets\" width=\"318\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\"></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p><strong>RPG生物等级系统</strong> 将Minecraft&rsquo;s战斗转化为动态的RPG体验，让每只生物随时间不断进化。敌人不再是固定不变的，生物会获得等级，在你存活和探索的时间越长，它们就越强大、越聪明、越危险。每次遭遇都独一无二，将简单的战斗转变为真正的挑战。</p>\n<h3>核心功能</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>动态生物等级</strong> &ndash; 生物强度会根据游戏进度、时间、距离或环境进行缩放</li>\n<li><strong>属性成长</strong> &ndash; 生物升级后生命值、伤害和能力提升</li>\n<li><strong>自适应难度</strong> &ndash; 随着探索深入，世界难度逐步提升</li>\n<li><strong>领地系统</strong> &ndash; 特定生物在自身领地内会更加具有攻击性</li>\n<li><strong>可配置进度</strong> &ndash; 自定义等级上限、缩放方式和难度</li>\n<li><strong>RPG体验</strong> &ndash; 将生存模式转变为基于进化的战斗体验</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span>支持与链接</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Discord：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK</a></li>\n<li>GitHub： <a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MeherBenSalem</a></li>\n<li>CurseForge： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects</a></li>\n<li>Modrinth： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>",
